                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6eaef13d-ed18-49bb-90b5-8691c7b142b4",
                                                "sense_id": "e03ecee1-75e7-3e8c-8392-668cd17a74ed",
                                                "text": "\"Your parents like Cool Hand Luke, yes?\" \"I don't really know. Why?\" \"Why? Because they name you Luke.\" I was worried I might have to explain that my name wasn't all that uncommon, and, anyway, Claudia had named me after the alter ego of Hank Williams, Luke the Drifter."
                                            },
